<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3971/76 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7229/34 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9383/90 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4655/65 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.55/56  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8110/30   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1707.8/8.8  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.85/95   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.8163/13   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0932/96   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5591/11   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6320/25</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$339.90/40</p>
</text>
